MY POSITION KEY, as used throughout this seat:
    f = b.fen().split(' ');  key = ' '.join(f[:2] + f[3:4])
    FEN fields: 0=placement 1=side 2=CASTLING 3=ep 4=halfmove 5=fullmove
    so f[:2] = placement+side, f[3:4] = EP ... CASTLING (field 2) IS EXCLUDED.

=> every 'root occurs 3 times' assertion in this seat counted occurrences with castling IGNORED.
